            "review_title": "Review at Thit Tot Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Leif Hauge\nMaura, Norway51 contributions\n0\nGood chicken\nSep 2017 • Couples\nA short trip away from our hotel, we chose this place for a quick dinner. We got welcomed by 3 employees that waited for us to make an order, with no time to check out the menu. They didn't speak english which made it a bit difficult to ask about the food, which was unfortunate as we were novices in korean food. The chicken was good, but kind of pricey (320k dong for 16 wings). It was well air-conditioned which was nice, but all in all not a place I would choose again.\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2017",
